  "$comment": "The stage-1 accounting as the COMPLETED experiment concluded it. An INPUT to reconciliation, never a function of present support: derived from live standing plus the current exception ledger, it would lose a coordinate the moment a suspension was settled and gain one the moment new evidence arrived, and either way the past would be authored by the present. Recovered by running the historical tree's own code over the historical tree's own fixtures — see recoveredFrom — and frozen here. The three evidence classes are kept apart because they are different claims: a primitive ratification, an interaction-only 2-set, and representation in a not-refuted closure are not synonyms, and their union is an accounting figure, not a standing figure.",
